WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.199 --> 00:00:02.135
It's a hard life out here.

00:00:02.835 --> 00:00:05.805
So a goal is to go out
trapping and get some fur.

00:00:06.672 --> 00:00:08.875
And the animals out here
that are growing with the land

00:00:09.742 --> 00:00:12.311
will make garments
that are meant to be on this land.

00:00:15.481 --> 00:00:17.216
This is what I'm looking for right here.

00:00:17.216 --> 00:00:19.018
I got a natural game trail.

00:00:19.018 --> 00:00:22.588
The animals, they continue to use this
because the snow is so deep,

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:26.025
they take advantage of any sort of little
like natural trail that they make

00:00:26.025 --> 00:00:30.963
and being on the border of this lake,
there's a lot of natural cubbies

00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:34.333
for me to set some traps,
but I have to be able to find them.

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:38.704
So I'll take advantage
of the bank of this lake and this game

00:00:38.704 --> 00:00:39.439
trail.

00:00:49.749 --> 00:00:52.885
I honestly think I can take advantage
of this little spot because there's

00:00:52.885 --> 00:00:56.722
a lot of these little alders standing up
and I can use that as a way to funnel

00:00:56.722 --> 00:01:00.793
the animals to the front of the trap,
so I might make that little game trail.

00:01:01.527 --> 00:01:06.899
You know, I got to walk up to the trap,
so using snowshoes kind of

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.302
makes a nice little trail for them.

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:10.603
What I'll do is I'll make a trail

00:01:10.603 --> 00:01:14.340
going to the front of where
I'm going to build a trap, and I'm making

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:17.977
a connecting trail to that game path
that I follow over there

00:01:19.312 --> 00:01:22.582
The middle of winter
is the prime time to trap.

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:26.619
The reason is the fur is the thickest,
and that's the type of fur that I'm after.

00:01:27.487 --> 00:01:29.489
It's a much better cubbie
than I thought it was going to be.

00:01:29.722 --> 00:01:33.025
I got these six branches
to work in my favor.

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:36.896
Uhh the back of it is just kind of
naturally encased

00:01:36.896 --> 00:01:40.266
in and close so the animal won't go
through the back and steal the bait.

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:43.703
It's going to come around to the easy
access, which will be the front.

00:01:43.703 --> 00:01:46.706
This is the caribou stomach
from the last caribou I'd shot.

00:01:47.006 --> 00:01:47.907
It's all frozen.

00:01:48.774 --> 00:01:50.510
It's technically fresh.

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:54.614
This is the stuff that wolverines
and scavengers and fox like to eat.

00:01:54.847 --> 00:01:56.415
So I'm going to offer them
this and I'm going

00:01:56.415 --> 00:01:59.652
throw it all the way in the back there.

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:03.389
I've used leg hole traps in the past,

00:02:03.389 --> 00:02:06.459
and they're not always
my favorite style of trap,

00:02:06.459 --> 00:02:10.530
so these are body gripping traps
and these are the most humane traps

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:14.100
you can use and they're
my preferred trap to use, so

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:18.304
I just take this rope, put it
through the hole here, straight through,

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:21.741
pull here and what that does is
compress the springs.

00:02:25.444 --> 00:02:27.146
So these are compressed these springs

00:02:27.146 --> 00:02:30.249
and I got a little clip that holds them on
and that's kind of like the safety.

00:02:30.716 --> 00:02:34.487
This is the trigger so if a wolverine
or a fox or something like that

00:02:34.487 --> 00:02:38.424
came through, it's going to hit these
and the strap will close on it.

00:02:41.394 --> 00:02:42.595
Any curious animal,

00:02:42.595 --> 00:02:45.331
it's going to find itself inside the body
trap before reaching the bait.

00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:46.599
There's no suffrage.

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:48.334
There's no pain.

00:02:50.369 --> 00:02:52.071
Because these things are,
these things are dangerous, man.

00:02:52.071 --> 00:02:54.807
I mean, this could easily break my arm.

00:02:55.241 --> 00:02:59.045
So then you got to feel confident with
you got to feel comfortable with or

00:02:59.579 --> 00:03:00.479
you’re gonna get yourself hurt.

